critical-wormhole-tools (0.4.0-1) unstable; urgency=medium

  * Initial release
  * Core tools: nc, ssh, scp, sftp, curl, wget
  * Additional tools: ping, rsync, proxy, tunnel, telnet, ftp, nmap
  * Wormhole Name Service (WNS) for persistent addresses
  * Browser extension support via daemon mode

 -- Critical Wormhole Team <team@example.com>  Fri, 10 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
